<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101809" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχεδι-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>do</i> a thing <i>off-hand</i> or <i>on the spur
				of the moment</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχεδιάζοντα λέγειν ὅ τι ἂν τύχῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sis.</u>
					387e
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>play off-hand</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαβὼν τὸ μελετητήριον, εἶτ᾽ ἐσχεδίασε
					δριμέως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anaxandr.
					15.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				6.1.11
			</span></i>; <i>invent stories</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.4.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.23
			</span></i>; <i>improvise</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.100
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); <i>give free play to the imagination</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.65
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>act with insufficient care</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς
				κοινοῖς πράγμασι</span> in public affairs, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				22.9.12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					13.31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ba.</u>
					1.19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
